---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Final Fantasy XVI — PS5 Buying Guide"
  description="Final Fantasy XVI buying guide: the action-RPG reboot, editions, and where to buy the digital PS5 version cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Final Fantasy XVI — PS5 Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">PlayStation 5 · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Final Fantasy XVI</strong> is Square Enix's bold turn into a mature,
      real-time action RPG built around clan politics and spectacular summon battles.
      It's the most graphically ambitious FF on console.
    </p>

    <h2>Editions explained</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Standard</strong> — the full game</li>
      <li><strong>Deluxe / Collector's</strong> — add a soundtrack, art book, and in-game cosmetics; no story content</li>
      <li><strong>Post-launch DLC</strong> — two story expansions (<em>Rising Tide</em>, <em>Echoes of the Fallen</em>) sold separately</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <p>
      Well past launch, FFXVI sees steady key-store discounts on Green Man Gaming that
      undercut the PlayStation Store. If you want the DLC too, watch for a complete
      bundle before buying piecemeal.
    </p>

    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=final+fantasy+16+ps5"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Final+Fantasy+XVI+PS5"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
